        "created_at": "2021-02-02T18:12:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can certainly see the positives and negatives of a new edition, so I remain on the fence, as I already have the complete run of Sentinels EE.</p>\n<p>That said?&nbsp; These changes sound fantastic.&nbsp; The evolution of C&amp;A as game designers is quite apparent.</p>",
